# Ulamog, the Defiler's ruling: its cast trigger resolves before Ulamog does, and still resolves if Ulamog is countered.
# Bot1 casts Ulamog on turn 3; Bot2 Counterspells it with the trigger above it on the stack. The trigger resolves first:
# Bot2 exiles the top half of its seven-card library, rounded up (four). Then the Counterspell counters Ulamog.

